'''Venisa Doza's X-wing'''<ref name="Bucket" /> was a modified [[X-wing starfighter]] owned by [[Resistance]] [[pilot]] [[Venisa Doza]]. [[Gender|She]] flew the [[starfighter]] during the [[First Order-Resistance War]], accompanied by her [[astromech droid]] [[Torch]].<ref name="Rendezvous Point" />

{{Ship-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Venisa Doza's X-wing first appeared in the ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'' [[Star Wars Resistance Season Two|season 2]] episode "[[Rendezvous Point (episode)|Rendezvous Point]]."<ref name="Rendezvous Point" /> The starfighter was designed by veteran modelmaker [[Bill George]], who created a 3D model that was then scanned to create the animation model. Both Doza's X-wing and her droid Torch were designed to look like she'd been using them since the era of the [[Galactic Civil War]], as she'd been a fighter pilot from a young age.<ref name="Bucket" />

